    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why i bother anymore. i've spent 3 years trying to fix this housing thing and every time i think i'm close the system just... resets. like i don't even exist to them. i'm just a file that keeps getting lost. it feels like the world is just designed to crush people like me until there's nothing left.",
