    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"keep breathing until the next person shows up\"... but what if there isn't anyone? i've been waiting for years and it's always just more silence. it feels like the only way to actually stop the cycle is to just... stop participating. like, if the system doesn't recognize my existence, maybe i shouldn't be part of it anymore. there's no peace in this, just constant noise and losing. i just want the noise to stop.",
